        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collection of all instrument set points and/or alarms.  Each instrument having an alarm or trip function is listed. Alarms and settings are given as percentages of transmitter range and in engineering units, together with transmitter range, location of the annunciation point, cabinet, identification and relevant P&amp;IDs/PEFS or logic drawing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
