        <hasCFIHOSCode>CFIHOS-70000169</hasCFIHOSCode>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Calculations to indicate basis on which equipment is sized, including pipe friction losses, equipment elevations and terminal point static pressures. Includes &apos;net positive suction head&apos; calculations and other steady state conditions. Also includes calculation of hydraulic surge (synonym &apos;water hammer&apos;) for the purpose of determining valve sizing, closing speed, etc.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <schema:identifier>4603</schema:identifier>
        <rdfs:label>hydraulic calculation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


