        <obo:IAO_0000115>A specification that describes the deliverable in terms of form, fit, function, and performance characteristics to satisfy the intended use where interpretation is required.Includes most discipline specifications describing the functionality (e.g., relief and blowdown specification, surface coating, inspection specifications, operating envelopes, etc.).</obo:IAO_0000115>
