        <obo:IAO_0000115>A transformer that, by electromagnetic induction, transforms a system of alternating voltage and current into another system of voltage and current usually of different values and at the same frequency for the purpose of transmitting electrical power.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>transformer</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


