        <hasSourceStandard rdf:resource="http://infohub.siemens-energy.com/CFIHOS#CFIHOS-90000177"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A semiconductor device that is a three-terminal semiconductor rectifier made up of four layers, p-n-p-n, so that when the fourth is positive with respect to the first, a voltage pulse applied to the third layer initiates a flow of current through the device which continues as long as it is greater than some minimum value.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>thyristor</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


