        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pressure vessel located in both pump- and compressor piping systems in order to reduce residual pulsation fluctuations, as a result of discontinue operation effects, within an allowable level specified.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>pulsation damper</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


