        <obo:IAO_0000115>A well is a collection of (zero or more) holes drilled into the Earth for the purpose of either (1) finding or producing underground resources; or (2) providing services related to the production of underground resources.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>well</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://infohub.siemens-energy.com/CFIHOS/tag#CFIHOS-30000284 -->


