        <obo:IAO_0000115>The wellhead is assembled from, or incorporates facilities for, the upper casing and tubing hangers. This effectively provides the upper termination of the wellbore and provides a mounting position for the surface flow-control equipment or Christmas tree.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>wellhead</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


