        <obo:IAO_0000115>A thermodynamic turbine in which steam is made to do work by expanding so as to create kinetic energy by acting on moving blades attached to a disc or drum.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>steam turbine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


