        <obo:IAO_0000115>A column in which a gas mixture is contacted with a liquid for the purpose of preferentially dissolving one or more components of the gas mixture and to provide a solution of them in the liquid.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>absorber column</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


