        <hasCFIHOSCode>CFIHOS-30000814</hasCFIHOSCode>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pressure vessel with internal packing intended to effect the main stream by introducing counter flow of a regenerative liquid or gas. Dehydration of gas by use of glycol is a typical application.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>contactor column</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


