        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pressure relief valve that is intended to release excess pressure or admit pressure to prevent a vacuum forming when filling or emptying a pipeline or tank.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>pressure-vacuum relief valve</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


