        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hoistwell or hoistway, is a shaft built into a building or structure to allow the lifting of goods and equipment. Designates a given area in a building where there may be a risk to personnel from suspended loads.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>hoistwell</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


