        <obo:IAO_0000115>A physical object that consists of two parallel steel rails, generally anchored perpendicular to beams or railroad ties of timber, concrete, or steel to maintain a consistent distance apart, to facilitate transport on the rails with vehicles arranged in a train without the need for steering.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>rail track</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


